.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt MOUNT_HAMMER 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mount_hammer
.Nd mount a HAMMER file system
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl o Ar options
.Ar special
.Ar node
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility attaches the single-volume HAMMER file system on
.Ar special
at mount point
.Ar node .
The kernel must be built with the HAMMERFS option.
This release mounts HAMMER version 7 volumes read-only; a mount without
.Cm ro
fails with
.Er EROFS .
Multi-volume file systems, pseudo-file systems and volumes that need
UNDO recovery are refused.
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl o Ar options
A comma-separated list of options: ro, rw, noexec, exec, nosuid, suid,
nodev and dev.
Other options are rejected.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mount 2 ,
.Xr unmount 2 ,
.Xr hammer 8 ,
.Xr mount 8 ,
.Xr newfs_hammer 8
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
utility first appeared in
.Dx 1.11 .
